    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SCAFFOLD - NOT A VERIFIED TEMPLATE\n\nThis workflow ALREADY EXISTS and runs in Hassan's n8n (Phase 0). It was\nnever captured in the repo, so this file is a reconstruction.\n\n**DO NOT ACTIVATE THIS ALONGSIDE YOUR EXISTING P0.x WORKFLOW.** Two copies\nwriting the same tables is worse than one.\n\nUse it for exactly one of:\n  - a reference if the original is ever lost;\n  - a diff against the original, to see what the repo believes it does.\n\n**Better: capture the REAL one instead.** In n8n, open your working\nworkflow -> ... menu -> Download. Then:\n\n    python scripts/sanitise_n8n_export.py <downloaded>.json n8n/\n\nThat strips every Config value (the service key) and writes a safe\n`*.template.json` you can commit. The real one beats this reconstruction.\n\n### What IS grounded here\nThe Supabase side: table and column names come from\n`sql/ad4_00_preflight.sql`, which is verified against a real Postgres.\nAnything writing to Supabase below is correct.\n\n### What is NOT\nThe Polymarket endpoint. This repo contains exactly one Polymarket URL\n(`gamma-api.polymarket.com/markets`, in `scripts/settlement.py`, itself\nflagged unverified). So the endpoint is a **Config field**, not a\nhardcoded guess - paste the real URL from your working workflow.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
